== Derivation from the Muse Gadgets SDK ==

This project is an independent Java re-implementation of the protocol parts of
the Muse Gadgets SDK (https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk),
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

Base version: this re-implementation is based on the SDK at commit
7b302e37561652eefcc8a4d58085de6f7f800f29 (2026-11-12), specifically its
linux/ (Python) implementation and bundled test vectors. Later upstream
changes are not automatically reflected here.

Changes relative to the SDK:
  * The protocol (BLE pairing v5 cryptography and message handling, Noise_XX
    transport, /link-control framing, request-body rules) is re-implemented in
    pure Java (Java 8 source level) instead of the SDK's original languages.
  * The code is written so that it can run on Android; it has no Android
    dependency itself.
  * tests/vectors/link_pairing_v5.json is an unmodified copy of the SDK's
    linux/tests/vectors/link_pairing_v5.json (Apache-2.0, Copyright Meta
    Platforms, Inc. and affiliates). It is synthetic public test data. The
    names it contains (device ids, node ids) are the SDK's own examples.
  * Files derived from the SDK carry a short attribution header naming
    their origin.

Intentional divergences from the SDK's behavior (hardening and API
choices made in this port, not in the base version):
  * JSON parsing rejects duplicate keys.
  * Inbound size caps where the SDK leaves inputs unbounded: a pairing
    message is rejected past 8,192 bytes before parsing, Noise frame
    reassembly is capped at 32 MiB of pending bytes in total, and a
    single /link-control fragment is capped at 16 MiB.
  * SdkToken exposes no partial-token "hint"; it reports only whether a
    token is set (SdkToken.status()).
  * SentenceStream force-flushes at 2,048 characters even when no
    sentence terminator has arrived.

Checking upstream drift: the protocol surface this port depends on
lives in the SDK's linux/ and protocols/ directories. Everything that
changed upstream since the base commit is visible at
https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk/compare/7b302e37561652eefcc8a4d58085de6f7f800f29...main
As of 2026-11-22, upstream was 99 commits ahead of the base, with no
changes under linux/ or protocols/.

== Third-party dependency ==

noise-java (https://github.com/rweather/noise-java), Copyright (c) Southern
Storm Software, Pty Ltd, MIT License. It is not bundled: build-and-test.sh
clones it at a pinned commit (49377b6dfc6a1e75740bce2318118291a57c0d6e) into
build-deps/ and compiles it together with this project.

